From 88cc527a16246bcbf9cd5b0c2b0cba06abab2527 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Igor Opaniuk <igor.opaniuk@oss.qualcomm.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 10:03:37 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] loaders: drop the partitions.conf format

No partitions.conf is left in the tree, so remove the .conf loader. A
.conf input now fails with a hint to describe the layout in YAML, and
gen_udev_rules no longer scans for .conf files.

The size grammar moves into the YAML loader with its tests. Tests that
compared YAML against .conf now pin the expected values directly.

Signed-off-by: Igor Opaniuk <igor.opaniuk@oss.qualcomm.com>
